completion.text:
I see the issues. The brief and watch-warm-up are coach tasks (on deck), not lane tasks—they should be in a separate coach track. And the sprint set barrier needs to be rethought: each lane's main set is independent, so I need to make the sprint step wait for all three main sets to complete, not replicate itself.

